{"text":"大代永平四年二月十日，清信士五品使□黄元德弟王奴等敬造彌勒像一區并五十三佛，爲亡母。願亡母託生西方妙樂國土，若人間王侯長俊。願合門大小見在安隱。復願一切衆生離苦去垢，□咸斯福，一時成佛。","tags":[{"name":"PersonName","term":"黄元德","refId":null,"text":"黄元德","start":18,"end":21},{"name":"PersonName","term":"王奴","refId":null,"text":"王奴","start":22,"end":24},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"彌勒","refId":null,"text":"彌勒","start":27,"end":29},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"五十三佛","refId":null,"text":"五十三佛","start":33,"end":37},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"託生","refId":null,"text":"託生","start":45,"end":47},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"西方","refId":null,"text":"西方","start":47,"end":49},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"妙樂國土","refId":null,"text":"妙樂國土","start":49,"end":53},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"眾生","refId":null,"text":"衆生","start":76,"end":78},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"離苦","refId":null,"text":"離苦","start":78,"end":80}]}